flowchart TD
    U[User] -->|signs in| Auth[Auth Route<br/>Email + Google]
    Auth --> Dash[Dashboard]

    Dash --> Intake[Intake<br/>Capture raw concept]
    Intake --> Vet[Vetting Chat<br/>AI Q&A refinement]
    Vet --> Pipe{{Vetting Pipeline}}

    Pipe --> Strat[Strategic Analysis]
    Pipe --> Comp[Compliance Analysis]
    Pipe --> Mkt[Market Research]
    Pipe --> Sales[Demand / Sales Analysis]

    Strat --> Report[Opportunity Report<br/>PDF export]
    Comp --> Report
    Mkt --> Report
    Sales --> Report

    subgraph SF[TanStack Server Functions]
        VetFn[vetting.functions]
        ChatFn[vetting-chat.functions]
        MktFn[market-research.functions]
        TplFn[prompt-templates.functions]
        SetFn[settings.functions]
    end

    Vet -.calls.-> ChatFn
    Pipe -.calls.-> VetFn
    Mkt -.calls.-> MktFn

    SF -->|RLS scoped| DB[(Supabase Postgres<br/>profiles · user_roles<br/>prompt_templates · vettings)]
    SF -->|prompts| AI[Lovable AI Gateway<br/>Gemini / GPT-5]
    SetFn --> Storage[(Storage: avatars)]

    Admin[Admin Panel<br/>/admin/prompt-templates] -->|has_role admin| TplFn
    TplFn --> DB

    classDef svc fill:transparent,stroke-width:2px;
    class SF,Pipe svc;
